(Helix demo - parametric pocket grid: subroutines, loops, expressions)
(edit the parameters below and reload - the toolpath follows)
(note: #<_name> params are global; plain #<name> are local to a sub)
G21 G90 G17

#<_cols>  = 3
#<_rows>  = 2
#<_pitch> = 35
#<_size>  = 6      (pocket half-width)
#<_depth> = 3

o100 sub (square pocket centered at #1 #2, depth #3)
G0 Z2
G0 X[#1 - #<_size>] Y[#2 - #<_size>]
G1 Z-#3 F300
G1 X[#1 + #<_size>] F700
G1 Y[#2 + #<_size>]
G1 X[#1 - #<_size>]
G1 Y[#2 - #<_size>]
G1 X[#1 + #<_size>] Y[#2 + #<_size>] (clear the middle)
G0 Z2
o100 endsub

M3 S9000 M8
#1 = 0
o200 while [#1 LT #<_cols>]
  #2 = 0
  o201 while [#2 LT #<_rows>]
    o100 call [[#1 * #<_pitch>] - #<_pitch>] [[#2 * #<_pitch>] - #<_pitch> / 2] [#<_depth>]
    #2 = [#2 + 1]
  o201 endwhile
  #1 = [#1 + 1]
o200 endwhile

(settle, then face one edge pass)
G4 P1
G0 Z2
G0 X-50 Y-35
G1 Z-1 F300
G1 X85 F900
G0 Z10
M5 M9
G0 X0 Y0
M2
